# Activate the kdev devShell whenever you cd into this directory or any
# subdirectory. Swap the flake reference if you've forked it or want to
# pin a local checkout for hacking on kdev itself:
#
#   use flake github:kiryl/kdev   # published flake (default)
#   use flake ~/git/kdev          # local checkout
#   use flake path:/abs/to/kdev   # explicit absolute path
use flake github:kiryl/kdev
